  "notes": [
    "All 90 exact script Voiceover excerpts are retained in order across 15 six-image boards. Starts are aligned sequentially against the complete timing-per-word.srt, not script estimates. First start is 0.000 to include leading silence.",
    "Source audio measured with ffprobe: 506.448 seconds. Fourteen 1.200-second narration-free jackdaw pulls add 16.800 seconds, producing 523.248 seconds. Beat phases use expanded video time; audio.pauses source_time and the unchanged SRT use source time.",
    "Final spoken cue ends at source 506.080 seconds (video 522.880); the 0.368-second audio tail holds the completed final board. No final slide or pause.",
