    "Beat 60 starts at source 330.24 seconds, where SRT transcribes script Ask as Last; the following phrase the same of other feelings confirms the boundary. Numbered introductions One/Two/Three/Four align to numeric SRT tokens. No interpolated beat boundaries are needed.",
