    "swipe-hand.png follows each completed drawing during placement in available-space mode, including cell 6, and during the shrink phase in zoom-up-draw mode. The drawing hand remains hand.png. Canvas mode has no placement swipe. Swipe settings do not change narration or board-transition timing."
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/01",
      "start": 0.0,
      "draw_start": 0.3,
      "draw_end": 5.64,
      "shrink_start": 5.84,
      "shrink_end": 6.26,
      "slide_start": 6.48,
      "end": 6.48,
      "narration": "A friend announces their promotion. You smile, say congratulations, and feel a small twist in your stomach."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/02",
      "start": 6.48,
      "draw_start": 6.78,
      "draw_end": 11.32,
      "shrink_start": 11.52,
      "shrink_end": 11.94,
      "slide_start": 12.16,
      "end": 12.16,
      "narration": "Later, you're picking holes in their success. Maybe they just got lucky. Why are you doing that?"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/03",
      "start": 12.16,
      "draw_start": 12.46,
      "draw_end": 16.04,
      "shrink_start": 16.24,
      "shrink_end": 16.66,
      "slide_start": 16.88,
      "end": 16.88,
      "narration": "Carl Jung called the parts of ourselves we struggle to recognize or accept our shadow."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/04",
      "start": 16.88,
      "draw_start": 17.18,
      "draw_end": 21.48,
      "shrink_start": 21.68,
      "shrink_end": 22.1,
      "slide_start": 22.32,
      "end": 22.32,
      "narration": "That includes envy or anger, but also confidence and creativity we've learned to keep out of sight."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/05",
      "start": 22.32,
      "draw_start": 22.62,
      "draw_end": 28.37,
      "shrink_start": 28.57,
      "shrink_end": 28.99,
      "slide_start": 29.21,
      "end": 29.21,
      "narration": "Integration means acknowledging those parts and taking responsibility for their expression. A feeling doesn't have to become an action."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/06",
      "start": 29.21,
      "draw_start": 29.51,
      "draw_end": 34.84,
      "shrink_start": 35.04,
      "shrink_end": 35.46,
      "slide_start": 35.84,
      "end": 37.04,
      "narration": "Here are seven practical ways to begin, inspired by Jung's ideas. Start with whichever feels familiar."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/07",
      "start": 37.04,
      "draw_start": 37.34,
      "draw_end": 41.4,
      "shrink_start": 41.6,
      "shrink_end": 42.02,
      "slide_start": 42.24,
      "end": 42.24,
      "narration": "One. Notice the moments that stay with you. The ones you replay long after they've happened."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/08",
      "start": 42.24,
      "draw_start": 42.54,
      "draw_end": 46.28,
      "shrink_start": 46.48,
      "shrink_end": 46.9,
      "slide_start": 47.12,
      "end": 47.12,
      "narration": "Someone interrupts you in a meeting. You're still arguing with them in your head while washing dishes."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/09",
      "start": 47.12,
      "draw_start": 47.42,
      "draw_end": 51.0,
      "shrink_start": 51.2,
      "shrink_end": 51.62,
      "slide_start": 51.84,
      "end": 51.84,
      "narration": "Pause. What actually happened? What did you feel? What did you want to do?"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/10",
      "start": 51.84,
      "draw_start": 52.14,
      "draw_end": 56.9,
      "shrink_start": 57.1,
      "shrink_end": 57.52,
      "slide_start": 57.74,
      "end": 57.74,
      "narration": "Maybe you felt dismissed. You wanted to interrupt back, leave, or prove you were the smartest person there."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/11",
      "start": 57.74,
      "draw_start": 58.04,
      "draw_end": 62.52,
      "shrink_start": 62.72,
      "shrink_end": 63.14,
      "slide_start": 63.36,
      "end": 63.36,
      "narration": "Write it down plainly. A few honest sentences give you more to work with than a sweeping judgment."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/12",
      "start": 63.36,
      "draw_start": 63.66,
      "draw_end": 68.52,
      "shrink_start": 68.72,
      "shrink_end": 69.14,
      "slide_start": 69.52,
      "end": 70.72,
      "narration": "You don't need to explain your entire personality. Get curious about this reaction, in this situation."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/13",
      "start": 70.72,
      "draw_start": 71.02,
      "draw_end": 75.32,
      "shrink_start": 75.52,
      "shrink_end": 75.94,
      "slide_start": 76.16,
      "end": 76.16,
      "narration": "Separate the event from your interpretation. They interrupted me is an observation you can examine."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/14",
      "start": 76.16,
      "draw_start": 76.46,
      "draw_end": 80.92,
      "shrink_start": 81.12,
      "shrink_end": 81.54,
      "slide_start": 81.76,
      "end": 81.76,
      "narration": "Nobody respects me is a bigger conclusion. It may feel true without describing everything that happened."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/15",
      "start": 81.76,
      "draw_start": 82.06,
      "draw_end": 86.42,
      "shrink_start": 86.62,
      "shrink_end": 87.04,
      "slide_start": 87.26,
      "end": 87.26,
      "narration": "Look for repetition. Does that feeling return when you're corrected, overlooked, or asked for help?"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/16",
      "start": 87.26,
      "draw_start": 87.56,
      "draw_end": 93.7,
      "shrink_start": 93.9,
      "shrink_end": 94.32,
      "slide_start": 94.54,
      "end": 94.54,
      "narration": "Strong reactions have many explanations, including tiredness or genuine mistreatment. They aren't proof of a hidden flaw."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/17",
      "start": 94.54,
      "draw_start": 94.84,
      "draw_end": 99.01,
      "shrink_start": 99.21,
      "shrink_end": 99.63,
      "slide_start": 99.85,
      "end": 99.85,
      "narration": "Still, a pattern raises a useful question: what feels threatened here, and why does it matter?"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/18",
      "start": 99.85,
      "draw_start": 100.15,
      "draw_end": 104.88,
      "shrink_start": 105.08,
      "shrink_end": 105.5,
      "slide_start": 105.88,
      "end": 107.08,
      "narration": "Leave room for an answer you haven't considered. You can investigate without putting yourself on trial."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/19",
      "start": 107.08,
      "draw_start": 107.38,
      "draw_end": 113.7,
      "shrink_start": 113.9,
      "shrink_end": 114.32,
      "slide_start": 114.54,
      "end": 114.54,
      "narration": "Two. Question your harshest judgments. Jung described projection as seeing in others qualities we don't acknowledge in ourselves."
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/20",
      "start": 114.54,
      "draw_start": 114.84,
      "draw_end": 119.24,
      "shrink_start": 119.44,
      "shrink_end": 119.86,
      "slide_start": 120.08,
      "end": 120.08,
      "narration": "Every annoying person isn't secretly a mirror. Sometimes their behavior really is inconsiderate."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/21",
      "start": 120.08,
      "draw_start": 120.38,
      "draw_end": 124.6,
      "shrink_start": 124.8,
      "shrink_end": 125.22,
      "slide_start": 125.44,
      "end": 125.44,
      "narration": "Still, why does one particular trait get so much of your attention? It's worth exploring."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/22",
      "start": 125.44,
      "draw_start": 125.74,
      "draw_end": 130.83,
      "shrink_start": 131.03,
      "shrink_end": 131.45,
      "slide_start": 131.67,
      "end": 131.67,
      "narration": "A colleague mentions their achievements. You think, I can't stand people who need attention. Sound familiar?"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/23",
      "start": 131.67,
      "draw_start": 131.97,
      "draw_end": 137.04,
      "shrink_start": 137.24,
      "shrink_end": 137.66,
      "slide_start": 137.88,
      "end": 137.88,
      "narration": "Perhaps they're dominating the conversation. Or perhaps you've made it impossible to acknowledge anything you're proud of."
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/24",
      "start": 137.88,
      "draw_start": 138.18,
      "draw_end": 141.86,
      "shrink_start": 142.06,
      "shrink_end": 142.48,
      "slide_start": 142.86,
      "end": 144.06,
      "narration": "Both are possible. You can ask for a fairer conversation while examining your own rules."
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/25",
      "start": 144.06,
      "draw_start": 144.36,
      "draw_end": 148.18,
      "shrink_start": 148.38,
      "shrink_end": 148.8,
      "slide_start": 149.02,
      "end": 149.02,
      "narration": "Complete this sentence: I judge people who do this because I believe it means they're..."
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/26",
      "start": 149.02,
      "draw_start": 149.32,
      "draw_end": 154.04,
      "shrink_start": 154.24,
      "shrink_end": 154.66,
      "slide_start": 154.88,
      "end": 154.88,
      "narration": "Then ask: do I recognize any of that impulse in myself? Be specific. Don't force an answer."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/27",
      "start": 154.88,
      "draw_start": 155.18,
      "draw_end": 159.06,
      "shrink_start": 159.26,
      "shrink_end": 159.68,
      "slide_start": 159.9,
      "end": 159.9,
      "narration": "Maybe you want credit but wait for people to notice. Then you resent them when they don't."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/28",
      "start": 159.9,
      "draw_start": 160.2,
      "draw_end": 165.1,
      "shrink_start": 165.3,
      "shrink_end": 165.72,
      "slide_start": 165.94,
      "end": 165.94,
      "narration": "Here's a possibility: wanting recognition doesn't automatically make me arrogant. I can ask for it honestly."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/29",
      "start": 165.94,
      "draw_start": 166.24,
      "draw_end": 171.04,
      "shrink_start": 171.24,
      "shrink_end": 171.66,
      "slide_start": 171.88,
      "end": 171.88,
      "narration": "Next time, describe your contribution without apologizing for it. Make space for yourself and others."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/30",
      "start": 171.88,
      "draw_start": 172.18,
      "draw_end": 176.6,
      "shrink_start": 176.8,
      "shrink_end": 177.22,
      "slide_start": 177.6,
      "end": 178.8,
      "narration": "Stay open to evidence. This exercise should help you see people more clearly, including yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/31",
      "start": 178.8,
      "draw_start": 179.1,
      "draw_end": 184.9,
      "shrink_start": 185.1,
      "shrink_end": 185.52,
      "slide_start": 185.74,
      "end": 185.74,
      "narration": "Three. Write the sentence you avoid. Find five quiet minutes with a notebook, somewhere you feel comfortable."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/32",
      "start": 185.74,
      "draw_start": 186.04,
      "draw_end": 188.99,
      "shrink_start": 189.19,
      "shrink_end": 189.61,
      "slide_start": 189.83,
      "end": 189.83,
      "narration": "Start with, what I don't want to admit is. Finish without trying to sound wise."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/33",
      "start": 189.83,
      "draw_start": 190.13,
      "draw_end": 193.78,
      "shrink_start": 193.98,
      "shrink_end": 194.4,
      "slide_start": 194.62,
      "end": 194.62,
      "narration": "I wanted them to fail. I'm tired of helping. I wish someone would take care of me."
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/34",
      "start": 194.62,
      "draw_start": 194.92,
      "draw_end": 198.28,
      "shrink_start": 198.48,
      "shrink_end": 198.9,
      "slide_start": 199.12,
      "end": 199.12,
      "narration": "You may dislike what you've written. Leave it there a moment, without making it a verdict."
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/35",
      "start": 199.12,
      "draw_start": 199.42,
      "draw_end": 203.64,
      "shrink_start": 203.84,
      "shrink_end": 204.26,
      "slide_start": 204.48,
      "end": 204.48,
      "narration": "Noticing a spiteful thought doesn't mean spite is your whole identity. Keep that difference in view."
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/36",
      "start": 204.48,
      "draw_start": 204.78,
      "draw_end": 208.74,
      "shrink_start": 208.94,
      "shrink_end": 209.36,
      "slide_start": 209.74,
      "end": 210.94,
      "narration": "You're describing your experience so you can understand it. Nobody else needs to read this draft."
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/37",
      "start": 210.94,
      "draw_start": 211.24,
      "draw_end": 216.28,
      "shrink_start": 216.48,
      "shrink_end": 216.9,
      "slide_start": 217.12,
      "end": 217.12,
      "narration": "Add another sentence: what I wanted in that moment was. Does anything more specific come into focus?"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/38",
      "start": 217.12,
      "draw_start": 217.42,
      "draw_end": 221.8,
      "shrink_start": 222.0,
      "shrink_end": 222.42,
      "slide_start": 222.64,
      "end": 222.64,
      "narration": "Behind wishing someone would fail, you might find disappointment about a project you haven't dared to start."
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/39",
      "start": 222.64,
      "draw_start": 222.94,
      "draw_end": 226.12,
      "shrink_start": 226.32,
      "shrink_end": 226.74,
      "slide_start": 226.96,
      "end": 226.96,
      "narration": "Behind being tired of helping, you might find you've agreed to more than you can carry."
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/40",
      "start": 226.96,
      "draw_start": 227.26,
      "draw_end": 232.28,
      "shrink_start": 232.48,
      "shrink_end": 232.9,
      "slide_start": 233.12,
      "end": 233.12,
      "narration": "These are possibilities, not hidden meanings you have to discover. An explanation should fit your experience."
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/41",
      "start": 233.12,
      "draw_start": 233.42,
      "draw_end": 237.96,
      "shrink_start": 238.16,
      "shrink_end": 238.58,
      "slide_start": 238.8,
      "end": 238.8,
      "narration": "End with one reasonable next step. Ask for help, make time, or acknowledge your disappointment."
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/42",
      "start": 238.8,
      "draw_start": 239.1,
      "draw_end": 242.2,
      "shrink_start": 242.4,
      "shrink_end": 242.82,
      "slide_start": 243.2,
      "end": 244.4,
      "narration": "Then close the notebook. You don't have to spend the evening taking yourself apart."
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/43",
      "start": 244.4,
      "draw_start": 244.7,
      "draw_end": 249.3,
      "shrink_start": 249.5,
      "shrink_end": 249.92,
      "slide_start": 250.14,
      "end": 250.14,
      "narration": "Four. Loosen the identity you defend. What sentence describes the kind of person you are?"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/44",
      "start": 250.14,
      "draw_start": 250.44,
      "draw_end": 255.56,
      "shrink_start": 255.76,
      "shrink_end": 256.18,
      "slide_start": 256.4,
      "end": 256.4,
      "narration": "I'm easygoing. I'm always independent. Everyone can rely on me. Each may describe something real."
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/45",
      "start": 256.4,
      "draw_start": 256.7,
      "draw_end": 260.12,
      "shrink_start": 260.32,
      "shrink_end": 260.74,
      "slide_start": 260.96,
      "end": 260.96,
      "narration": "Trouble starts when you protect that description at the expense of what you're actually feeling."
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/46",
      "start": 260.96,
      "draw_start": 261.26,
      "draw_end": 265.88,
      "shrink_start": 266.08,
      "shrink_end": 266.5,
      "slide_start": 266.72,
      "end": 266.72,
      "narration": "If you're always easygoing, where does frustration go? If you're independent, can you ask for support?"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/47",
      "start": 266.72,
      "draw_start": 267.02,
      "draw_end": 270.76,
      "shrink_start": 270.96,
      "shrink_end": 271.38,
      "slide_start": 271.6,
      "end": 271.6,
      "narration": "The label is like an outgrown jacket. Appreciate what it gave you, and loosen it."
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/48",
      "start": 271.6,
      "draw_start": 271.9,
      "draw_end": 277.38,
      "shrink_start": 277.58,
      "shrink_end": 278.0,
      "slide_start": 278.38,
      "end": 279.58,
      "narration": "Add two words: sometimes, and also. I'm sometimes patient. I also get frustrated and need breaks."
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/49",
      "start": 279.58,
      "draw_start": 279.88,
      "draw_end": 283.4,
      "shrink_start": 283.6,
      "shrink_end": 284.02,
      "slide_start": 284.24,
      "end": 284.24,
      "narration": "That sounds small. But it gives you a more honest sentence for an ordinary conversation."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/50",
      "start": 284.24,
      "draw_start": 284.54,
      "draw_end": 289.73,
      "shrink_start": 289.93,
      "shrink_end": 290.35,
      "slide_start": 290.57,
      "end": 290.57,
      "narration": "Instead of, whatever you want, try, I'd prefer somewhere quiet tonight. No dramatic announcement needed."
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/51",
      "start": 290.57,
      "draw_start": 290.87,
      "draw_end": 295.08,
      "shrink_start": 295.28,
      "shrink_end": 295.7,
      "slide_start": 295.92,
      "end": 295.92,
      "narration": "Instead of accepting another task, try, I can help tomorrow, but I don't have time today."
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/52",
      "start": 295.92,
      "draw_start": 296.22,
      "draw_end": 300.12,
      "shrink_start": 300.32,
      "shrink_end": 300.74,
      "slide_start": 300.96,
      "end": 300.96,
      "narration": "People may be surprised if you rarely express preferences. Give them a chance to hear you."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/53",
      "start": 300.96,
      "draw_start": 301.26,
      "draw_end": 305.46,
      "shrink_start": 305.66,
      "shrink_end": 306.08,
      "slide_start": 306.3,
      "end": 306.3,
      "narration": "Allow yourself to feel awkward, too. An unfamiliar response doesn't have to be a dishonest one."
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/54",
      "start": 306.3,
      "draw_start": 306.6,
      "draw_end": 311.57,
      "shrink_start": 311.77,
      "shrink_end": 312.19,
      "slide_start": 312.57,
      "end": 313.77,
      "narration": "You can be kind, capable, and dependable while being accurate about your limits. There's room for both."
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/55",
      "start": 313.77,
      "draw_start": 314.07,
      "draw_end": 319.32,
      "shrink_start": 319.52,
      "shrink_end": 319.94,
      "slide_start": 320.16,
      "end": 320.16,
      "narration": "Five. Give the feeling a responsible outlet. Acknowledging anger doesn't require saying every angry thought aloud."
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/56",
      "start": 320.16,
      "draw_start": 320.46,
      "draw_end": 324.52,
      "shrink_start": 324.72,
      "shrink_end": 325.14,
      "slide_start": 325.36,
      "end": 325.36,
      "narration": "Someone keeps taking credit for your work. Your anger may point to something worth addressing directly."
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/57",
      "start": 325.36,
      "draw_start": 325.66,
      "draw_end": 329.48,
      "shrink_start": 329.68,
      "shrink_end": 330.1,
      "slide_start": 330.32,
      "end": 330.32,
      "narration": "Wait until you can speak clearly. Describe what happened and what you'd like to change."
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/58",
      "start": 330.32,
      "draw_start": 330.62,
      "draw_end": 335.46,
      "shrink_start": 335.66,
      "shrink_end": 336.08,
      "slide_start": 336.3,
      "end": 336.3,
      "narration": "Try, I prepared that section. Next meeting, please make my contribution clear when you present it."
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/59",
      "start": 336.3,
      "draw_start": 336.6,
      "draw_end": 340.2,
      "shrink_start": 340.4,
      "shrink_end": 340.82,
      "slide_start": 341.04,
      "end": 341.04,
      "narration": "You haven't buried your anger or used it to humiliate someone. You've chosen a response."
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/60",
      "start": 341.04,
      "draw_start": 341.34,
      "draw_end": 344.2,
      "shrink_start": 344.4,
      "shrink_end": 344.82,
      "slide_start": 345.2,
      "end": 346.4,
      "narration": "Ask the same of other feelings: what response can I stand behind afterward?"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/61",
      "start": 346.4,
      "draw_start": 346.7,
      "draw_end": 350.52,
      "shrink_start": 350.72,
      "shrink_end": 351.14,
      "slide_start": 351.36,
      "end": 351.36,
      "narration": "Envy might prompt you to practice. Wanting attention might prompt you to share work you've hidden."
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/62.png,.jpeg",
      "start": 351.36,
      "draw_start": 351.66,
      "draw_end": 356.12,
      "shrink_start": 356.32,
      "shrink_end": 356.74,
      "slide_start": 356.96,
      "end": 356.96,
      "narration": "Feelings don't guarantee good advice. Consider the facts, your values, and the effects on others."
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/63",
      "start": 356.96,
      "draw_start": 357.26,
      "draw_end": 361.3,
      "shrink_start": 361.5,
      "shrink_end": 361.92,
      "slide_start": 362.14,
      "end": 362.14,
      "narration": "Too worked up to do that? Leave the message unsent. Read it later, more carefully."
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/64",
      "start": 362.14,
      "draw_start": 362.44,
      "draw_end": 367.24,
      "shrink_start": 367.44,
      "shrink_end": 367.86,
      "slide_start": 368.08,
      "end": 368.08,
      "narration": "Already lashed out? Take responsibility for what you did. Explaining it doesn't erase its impact."
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/65",
      "start": 368.08,
      "draw_start": 368.38,
      "draw_end": 372.52,
      "shrink_start": 372.72,
      "shrink_end": 373.14,
      "slide_start": 373.36,
      "end": 373.36,
      "narration": "I was embarrassed, and I spoke unfairly. I'm sorry. Here's what I'll do differently next time."
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/66",
      "start": 373.36,
      "draw_start": 373.66,
      "draw_end": 378.76,
      "shrink_start": 378.96,
      "shrink_end": 379.38,
      "slide_start": 379.76,
      "end": 380.96,
      "narration": "That's practical integration: notice an impulse, consider it honestly, and practice a response you'd like to repeat."
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/67",
      "start": 380.96,
      "draw_start": 381.26,
      "draw_end": 388.5,
      "shrink_start": 388.7,
      "shrink_end": 389.12,
      "slide_start": 389.34,
      "end": 389.34,
      "narration": "Six. Reclaim a quality you admire. Jung's shadow also includes valuable qualities we haven't acknowledged or developed."
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/68",
      "start": 389.34,
      "draw_start": 389.64,
      "draw_end": 394.56,
      "shrink_start": 394.76,
      "shrink_end": 395.18,
      "slide_start": 395.4,
      "end": 395.4,
      "narration": "Whose confidence, playfulness, or creativity catches your attention? What do they give themselves permission to do?"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/69",
      "start": 395.4,
      "draw_start": 395.7,
      "draw_end": 399.83,
      "shrink_start": 400.03,
      "shrink_end": 400.45,
      "slide_start": 400.67,
      "end": 400.67,
      "narration": "Maybe they ask questions, make imperfect art, or rest without explaining why they've earned it."
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/70",
      "start": 400.67,
      "draw_start": 400.97,
      "draw_end": 405.04,
      "shrink_start": 405.24,
      "shrink_end": 405.66,
      "slide_start": 405.88,
      "end": 405.88,
      "narration": "Admiration doesn't prove equal ability. But it can reveal something you'd like to practice yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/71",
      "start": 405.88,
      "draw_start": 406.18,
      "draw_end": 409.88,
      "shrink_start": 410.08,
      "shrink_end": 410.5,
      "slide_start": 410.72,
      "end": 410.72,
      "narration": "What makes that quality feel unavailable? Have you learned that being visible means showing off?"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/72",
      "start": 410.72,
      "draw_start": 411.02,
      "draw_end": 414.5,
      "shrink_start": 414.7,
      "shrink_end": 415.12,
      "slide_start": 415.5,
      "end": 416.7,
      "narration": "Or that playing wastes time? Name the rule, then decide whether you still agree."
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "board": 13,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/73",
      "start": 416.7,
      "draw_start": 417.0,
      "draw_end": 421.16,
      "shrink_start": 421.36,
      "shrink_end": 421.78,
      "slide_start": 422.0,
      "end": 422.0,
      "narration": "Try a small version. Ask one question, draw one page, or take an unhurried break."
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "board": 13,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/74",
      "start": 422.0,
      "draw_start": 422.3,
      "draw_end": 425.48,
      "shrink_start": 425.68,
      "shrink_end": 426.1,
      "slide_start": 426.32,
      "end": 426.32,
      "narration": "You don't need to become that person. You're allowing more range in your own behavior."
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "board": 13,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/75",
      "start": 426.32,
      "draw_start": 426.62,
      "draw_end": 431.49,
      "shrink_start": 431.69,
      "shrink_end": 432.11,
      "slide_start": 432.33,
      "end": 432.33,
      "narration": "If creativity was dismissed growing up, making something may feel embarrassing before it's enjoyable. Go slowly."
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "board": 13,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/76",
      "start": 432.33,
      "draw_start": 432.63,
      "draw_end": 437.8,
      "shrink_start": 438.0,
      "shrink_end": 438.42,
      "slide_start": 438.64,
      "end": 438.64,
      "narration": "Notice what happens. Did someone criticize you, or were you anticipating criticism that never arrived?"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "board": 13,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/77",
      "start": 438.64,
      "draw_start": 438.94,
      "draw_end": 443.27,
      "shrink_start": 443.47,
      "shrink_end": 443.89,
      "slide_start": 444.11,
      "end": 444.11,
      "narration": "If it goes badly, adjust. One uncomfortable afternoon doesn't settle what you're allowed to enjoy."
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "board": 13,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/78",
      "start": 444.11,
      "draw_start": 444.41,
      "draw_end": 448.66,
      "shrink_start": 448.86,
      "shrink_end": 449.28,
      "slide_start": 449.66,
      "end": 450.86,
      "narration": "Keep practicing that willingness to want things, learn things, and let yourself be seen trying."
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "board": 14,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/79",
      "start": 450.86,
      "draw_start": 451.16,
      "draw_end": 455.8,
      "shrink_start": 456.0,
      "shrink_end": 456.42,
      "slide_start": 456.64,
      "end": 456.64,
      "narration": "Seven. Let someone help you see. We can't notice everything when we're the only person asking questions."
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "board": 14,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/80",
      "start": 456.64,
      "draw_start": 456.94,
      "draw_end": 461.8,
      "shrink_start": 462.0,
      "shrink_end": 462.42,
      "slide_start": 462.64,
      "end": 462.64,
      "narration": "Choose someone honest and considerate. Ask about a specific pattern, rather than your entire character."
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "board": 14,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/81",
      "start": 462.64,
      "draw_start": 462.94,
      "draw_end": 467.32,
      "shrink_start": 467.52,
      "shrink_end": 467.94,
      "slide_start": 468.16,
      "end": 468.16,
      "narration": "Try, when I feel criticized, do I interrupt before you've finished? What have you noticed?"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "board": 14,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/82",
      "start": 468.16,
      "draw_start": 468.46,
      "draw_end": 473.08,
      "shrink_start": 473.28,
      "shrink_end": 473.7,
      "slide_start": 473.92,
      "end": 473.92,
      "narration": "Ask for an example. You don't have to agree immediately. Their interpretation isn't automatically the truth."
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "board": 14,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/83",
      "start": 473.92,
      "draw_start": 474.22,
      "draw_end": 477.8,
      "shrink_start": 478.0,
      "shrink_end": 478.42,
      "slide_start": 478.64,
      "end": 478.64,
      "narration": "But if it matches something you've noticed, consider it before rushing to explain it away."
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "board": 14,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/84",
      "start": 478.64,
      "draw_start": 478.94,
      "draw_end": 482.76,
      "shrink_start": 482.96,
      "shrink_end": 483.38,
      "slide_start": 483.76,
      "end": 484.96,
      "narration": "You might say, I can see that. Next time, I'll try letting you finish before responding."
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "board": 15,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/85",
      "start": 484.96,
      "draw_start": 485.26,
      "draw_end": 489.99,
      "shrink_start": 490.19,
      "shrink_end": 490.61,
      "slide_start": 490.83,
      "end": 490.83,
      "narration": "If reflection becomes overwhelming, pause. A qualified therapist can help you explore it with support."
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "board": 15,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/86",
      "start": 490.83,
      "draw_start": 491.13,
      "draw_end": 496.32,
      "shrink_start": 496.52,
      "shrink_end": 496.94,
      "slide_start": 497.16,
      "end": 497.16,
      "narration": "For now, choose one exercise this week. Notice a reaction, write honestly, or try a small change."
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "board": 15,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/87",
      "start": 497.16,
      "draw_start": 497.46,
      "draw_end": 502.8,
      "shrink_start": 503.0,
      "shrink_end": 503.42,
      "slide_start": 503.64,
      "end": 503.64,
      "narration": "You don't need complete self-understanding to behave differently. The next ordinary moment gives you somewhere to begin."
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "board": 15,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/88",
      "start": 503.64,
      "draw_start": 503.94,
      "draw_end": 508.12,
      "shrink_start": 508.32,
      "shrink_end": 508.74,
      "slide_start": 508.96,
      "end": 508.96,
      "narration": "Remember your friend's promotion? You might still feel envy. This time, you can admit it's there."
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "board": 15,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/89",
      "start": 508.96,
      "draw_start": 509.26,
      "draw_end": 514.76,
      "shrink_start": 514.96,
      "shrink_end": 515.38,
      "slide_start": 515.6,
      "end": 515.6,
      "narration": "Congratulate them sincerely. Then consider what you want to work toward. You can be happy for them and want more yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "board": 15,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/90",
      "start": 515.6,
      "draw_start": 515.9,
      "draw_end": 521.88,
      "shrink_start": 522.08,
      "shrink_end": 522.5,
      "slide_start": 523.248,
      "end": 523.248,
      "narration": "That's a practical beginning: recognizing more of yourself, taking responsibility, and choosing what to do next with your eyes open."
    }
  ],
